            "doc": "Complex-plane centre, as a flat FOUR-WORD `Expansion<4>` per axis\n(`w0..w3`, most significant first, kept flat so the typed Wasm ABI and\nrender uniform layout are plain f32 members): `w0` carries the\nvisible position, `w1`/`w2`/`w3` the deep low-order words (~1e-27) that\nkeep the per-pixel/per-gesture step from vanishing far past the ~1e-11\ndf64 wall. `navigate` folds gesture deltas into all four words via the\ngeneral `add_f32<4>`; `escape` stitches them into one `Fixed<8>`.",
